Sat Nov  7 12:00:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of xfe 2.1.13 for openSUSE Leap 16.0
  * Build against fox16 1.6.57 from openSUSE:Backports:SLE-16.0
  * Enable startup notification, XRandR and the udisks2/libnotify
    based automounter (xfe-automount)
  * Use --enable-minimalflags so that %optflags are respected
  * Move the Norwegian translation to the nb locale directory
  * Fix the main category of the Xfp desktop entry
  * Do not install the redundant (and partly empty) XPM icons
